---
/* THE KIT — 04/10/2026, Session 28 (docs/roadmap.md, equipment). Three pages: the
   blade, drawn from the rig's own numbers; the boot; and looking after both. Nothing
   here names a product, a model or a maker (the roadmap's standing rule). */
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/url.js';
import { KIT } from '../../lib/kit.js';
---
<Base title="Kit" subtitle="The blade, the boot and how to look after them, without naming a single brand.">
  <h1>Kit</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    What a figure skate is made of and why it is shaped the way it is, so that the rest
    of the guide makes sense, and so that the questions of a skater's first month have
    somewhere to land.
  </p>
  <ul class="plain">
    {KIT.map(k => <li><a href={url(`kit/${k.slug}/`)}>{k.name}</a><span>{k.summary}</span></li>)}
  </ul>
  <p class="note">
    The guide names no products, models or makers, here or anywhere else. What a rocker or
    a hollow does is the same whoever grinds it. A skate shop or a coach can say which
    boot and blade suit you.
  </p>

</Base>
